# Grammar sources of the vendored tree-sitter parsers (tools/tree-sitter-*/).
#
# Each directory holds a generated parser.c (3 to 44 MB) next to the grammar that
# produced it; the copy the product compiles lives under internal/cbm/vendored/,
# which discovery never enters. The test-impact artifact job builds the code graph
# of HEAD from scratch whenever no previous bundle exists, and it must finish inside
# a fixed 30-minute deadline. With these parsers in the graph that build took 27 to
# 34 minutes and failed with "reading HEAD sources failed: internal/cbm/ac.c".
# tools/tests/test_generated_sources_excluded_from_graph.py keeps a new grammar
# from reintroducing this.
/tools/tree-sitter-*/
